  "challenge": "IN-001 is already dispositive without a human: its own policy states you cannot fulfill an unknown SKU, and the item lookup confirmed WidgetC is absent from the catalog (found=false) with no canonical name, stock, or reference price. That is a hard catalog miss, not an ambiguous one-off—WidgetA and WidgetB match the catalog exactly at $250 and $500, so the invoice is otherwise clean and WidgetC is not a plausible miscode of either. TM-002 is explicitly LOW and only 'worth surfacing,' not a hold; rejecting for the unknown line and having the vendor resubmit with a real SKU (or after cataloguing) resolves both issues without escalation. No prior INV-1016 and zero audit history for Widgets Inc. do not create a judgment call when the HIGH finding's rationale already forbids fulfillment.",
  "proposed_outcome": "REJECT",
